windvale-assembly 1

# ABI 25 value boundary over the existing version-two shared/budgeted leaves.
# R8=context11, R9=64-byte compiler-private request. Generated frame admission
# proves the complete cell extents and their type; this helper proves handles
# and ranges again before provider access. No allocator or ambient authority.
# Request: version1,size64,action,flags0; destination,source,argument cell
# addresses at16/24/32; u64 operands at40/48; reserved zero at56.
# Private actions:0 retain,1 release,2 copy,3 move,4 literal,5 decode,6 split,
# 7 release unique builder,8 release budget,9 move builder,10 borrow builder,
# 16 query budget,17 move budget,18 borrow budget. Release and transfer actions
# clear the consumed cell. Budget and builder tokens have distinct dispatch.
# WVB229..241 use the same action numbers. Allocation Result destinations
# are80B; append Result<unit,LimitFailure> uses the existing96B nested layout.
# Scratch is488B plus ten saved registers. A private bootstrap construction
# temporarily owns the already reserved destination backing, then transfers it.
